{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>They surrounded me</b> — the sense is many, from every side." "<b>Bull-like ones of Bashan</b> — like עגלי (calves of), after the manner of פרות הבשן (cows of Bashan)." "<b>They crowned me</b> — from כתר (crown) of kingship, which is round."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:11.166751727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}